  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="39">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 39</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif hwa preoste ofslea. Gyf hwa weofodðegen afylle, sy he utlaga wið God ⁊ wið men, buton he ðurh wrecsið ðe deoppor gebete ⁊ eac wið ða mægða, oððe ladige mid werlade.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If anyone slay a priest. If anyone slays a minister of the altar, he shall be both excommunicated and outlawed, unless he make amends to the best of his ability by pilgrimage, and likewise by [the payment of compensation] to the kin [of the slain man], or else he shall clear himself by an oath equal in value to his wergeld.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gyf hwa weofodþen afylle, sy he utlah wið God ⁊ wið men, butan he þurh wræcðsið þe deoppor gebete, ⁊ eac wið ða mægðe; oððe geladige hine mid werlade.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
